OL,3,GNEWSASuspicious package sent to hotel
OL,4,Acontained explosive device
OL,5,
OL,6,FA suspect package delivered to a hotel
OL,7,Fin Londonderry contained a "viable"
OL,8,Fexplosive device, police have said.
OL,10,FArmy bomb experts were sent to the
OL,11,Fhotel at Ebrington Square in the
OL,12,FWaterside after the package was
OL,13,Fdiscovered at about 15:20 GMT on
OL,14,FTuesday.
OL,16,FThey carried out a controlled explosion
OL,17,Fon the device, which was later taken
OL,18,Faway for a forensic examination.
OL,20,FDet Supt Kearney condemned it as a
OL,21,F"reckless and targeted attack".
